                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "label": "Exclusion",
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "example",
                  "example": "labs/pg-boolean-exclusion"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "BooleanOps samples VectorEntity paths, bakes accumulated world transforms, performs polygon clipping and optionally reconstructs smooth curves. The output is a new Path. It can contain multiple regions and holes; a boolean operation does not modify its operands."
        },
        {
          "type": "example",
          "example": "labs/pg-booleanscene"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "accuracy-and-topology",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Accuracy and topology"
        },
        {
          "type": "tabs",
          "tabs": [
            {
              "label": "Path Hole",
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "example",
                  "example": "labs/pg-path-hole"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "label": "Pipeline Tolerance",
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "example",
                  "example": "labs/pg-pipeline-tolerance"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "resolution, simplifyTolerance, reconstructCurves and minArea control approximation and cleanup. Small gaps, tangencies, narrow slivers and highly curved contours need more sampling. Smooth reconstruction is an approximation after polygon clipping, so use a tighter tolerance when boundaries represent exact mathematical quantities."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Exact contracts: [BooleanOps](/api-entities-composites-geometry#booleanops), [Union](/api-entities-composites-geometry#booleanops), [Difference](/api-entities-composites-geometry#booleanops), [Intersection](/api-entities-composites-geometry#booleanops), [Exclusion](/api-entities-composites-geometry#booleanops)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "explain-geometric-relationships",
