            {
              "label": "Live arrow",
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "example",
                  "example": "labs/pg-arrow-live-endpoint"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Arrow and Arrow3D provide heads, curved shafts and configurable tips. Brace uses an entity’s bounds to place a mathematical bracket and optional label. PixelGrid builds a tiled matrix that can illustrate images, numerical data or spatial maps. These are composites rather than primitive lines; inspect children or use the public methods when styling them."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Exact contracts: [Arrow](/api-entities-composites-geometry#arrow), [ArrowTipType](/api-entities-composites-geometry#arrow), [Arrow3D](/api-entities-composites-geometry#arrow3d), [Brace](/api-entities-composites-geometry#brace), [PixelGrid](/api-entities-composites-geometry#pixelgrid)."
        }
      ]
    }
